WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.930
What's going on?

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.340
Hey, what are you doing?

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:28.920
The power of the gods should only 
be able to dwell within a pure soul...

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.890
It cannot dwell within the body of 
a human born with original sin...

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.280
It's all ruined... my thousand-year plan...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:49.490
But I'll still get the power
 of the gods for myself!

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.460
<i>Hibiki Tachibana... what are you?</i>

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:16.440
<i>It has been 48 hours since 
Hibiki Tachibana was absorbed by the energy</i>

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:19.640
Hibiki's Birthday ♥

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.020
<i>that we're calling the power of the gods.</i>

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>The negotiations at the UN 
are in their final stages.</i>

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.210
<i>Military intervention within Japanese 
borders will soon be authorized.</i>

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:33.780
<i>When that happens, S.O.N.G. will have to 
lead the attack under the command of the UN...</i>

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.740
So it's just what we feared.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.620
<i>And due to the severity of the situation...</i>

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:44.530
<i>use of reactive weapons may be authorized.</i>

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:48.450
Reactive weapons? But Hibiki-kun is inside!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.210
<i>Of course, we have no intention
 of letting that happen.</i>

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:59.670
<i>But the US government is getting antsy 
about what could be a global disaster.</i>

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:07.050
The military satellite that was 
destroyed gave them an excuse!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.050
<i>I want you to keep working
 on a way to fix this.</i>

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.540
<i>That could give us more room to negotiate.</i>

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.310
Got it. Thanks, Brother.

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:21.330
A UN military intervention...

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:28.200
Who would've thought we'd be in the same 
situation Valverde was mere weeks ago.

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:33.490
I've detected Hibiki-san's 
vitals within that cocoon.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:38.760
The god-killer power is probably 
preventing it from fusing with her...

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.680
But how long will it last?

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.620
We need to do something with 
the little time it's giving us.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.100
Yes. That's their job.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.390
"Their"?

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.110
Hibiki is inside that, right?

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.360
Is she okay?

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:57.880
Of course.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.960
That's why I brought you here.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.400
Connect me to Maria-kun.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.030
Yes, sir.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.990
<i>We're ready here.</i>

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.000
How can I help Hibiki?

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.960
Use this.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.290
<i>LiNKER? No, that's...</i>

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.660
<i>Anti-LiNKER.</i>

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.790
LiNKER and Anti-LiNKER are 
two sides of the same coin.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:23.890
I'm now able to create Anti-LiNKER, as well.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:29.220
<i>But the Anti-LiNKER lowers compatibility 
coefficients. So how...</i>

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.150
The Youaltepuztli and Divine Weapon

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:37.220
both consist of energy, 
encircling and affixing itself to a vessel.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:41.910
Doesn't that sound like the same 
mechanism as the Symphogears?

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:51.250
If the energy surrounding Hibiki-kun is similar
 to that of the relics that form the Gears...

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:55.630
We may be able to strip her 
naked with the Anti-LiNKER!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.150
Yes... and for that...

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.730
A convert unit?

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.830
Then...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.370
The recoil corruption has been removed.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.840
They're ready to go at any time.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:11.160
Um... if there's anything I can do...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.650
You're our ace in the hole for this mission.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.920
Our trump card.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.180
Me?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.300
I know it's dangerous, but please help us...

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.560
Okay!

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.360
And there's one more...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.350
You can't treat her that 
way if she's helping us.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.810
Put those guns down.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.600
Understood... But, sir...

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.320
Even if she does try something,

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.620
you'll just make it harder for me to act.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.350
Was my information helpful?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.360
I wouldn't have been able 
to remove the corruption

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:51.560
without the technology of 
the Philosopher's Stone.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.730
Thank you!

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.720
I'm glad it helped.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:59.280
So, you say you can help us...

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.100
I won't work hand in hand with you, though.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:04.990
What's wrong?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.620
Commander! Incoming message from Kamakura!

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.820
<i>I have put the Disaster Deployment Law for 
the Protection of the Nation into effect.</i>

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.490
The what?

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:18.990
Then Tachibana was designated 
a type-2 special disaster?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.140
<i>In the event of a disaster 
involving the relics,</i>

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.000
<i>all restrictions on the
 use of force are suspended.</i>

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.050
<i>Destroy the target immediately!</i>

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.120
But we're currently working 
on a way to save her—

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.890
<i>How sad.</i>

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.470
<i>Would you allow the UN onto our soil?</i>

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:39.030
<i>They intend to use reactive weapons.</i>

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.360
<i>They'll burn our nation to the ground!</i>

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.490
Wait! Hibiki isn't a special disaster!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.590
She's... my friend!

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.950
If the duty of the Kazanaris
 is to protect our nation,

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.790
as its black sheep, I choose to protect
 my friend and the people!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.050
<i>Tsubasa!</i>

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:59.920
<i>Do you not know what blood 
flows in your veins?</i>

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.630
I don't care!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:07.830
The only thing that flows in my veins 
is the lifeblood of Kanade Amou!

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:16.430
<i>Commander, an attack force has 
deployed around Hibiki-chan.</i>

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:19.210
<i>The operation begins in two hours.</i>

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.950
<i>The justice I have chosen
 cannot be undone.</i>

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.810
He is another one who enforces control.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:36.380
<i>Initiate second attack!</i>

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.510
<i>Initiating second attack!</i>

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.540
<i>All rounds hit!</i>

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.630
<i>Crack sighted in target's exterior!</i>

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.640
<i>Attack was effective!</i>

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.580
Haven't they been told?

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.970
There's a person inside there!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.920
At this rate, Hibiki-chan will be...

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.310
<i>Initiate third attack!</i>

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.530
<i>Wait! Look at that!</i>

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:56.360
<i>No! Did our attack just 
make her wake up sooner?!</i>

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.260
Are you okay, Maria?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.150
That ridiculous strength...

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:13.510
Somehow it seems just like Hibiki-san!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.000
We're taking over this battlefield.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.340
Retreat!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.650
Are you the UN's advance force?

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.300
We're under the Japanese government's orders.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.470
We've been given no order to withdraw!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.310
If you need a reason, I'll give you one...

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:35.270
Are you helping us?

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.580
I'm not fighting beside you.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.490
This is my battle.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:49.040
Special vehicle unit has arrived!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.700
We're ready, Commander!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:56.310
Okay, let's start Hibiki-kun's 
birthday party!

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.120
First, we'll pin her down!

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.280
Let's tame this wild horse!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.160
<b>Shadow Weave</b>

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.610
Anti-personnel weapons are no use...

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.450
But it gave us an opening we won't waste!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:41.420
Without the god-killer, 
this is our only option!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.270
Stop right there!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:07.480
Maria, we'll bring our power...

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:08.600
...together!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.600
You're not alone!

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.620
We'll all save her together!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.190
Now, Ogawa-san!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.900
We're ready!

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:55.650
Anti-LiNKER has hit. Injecting drug!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:59.250
Target's compatibility 
coefficient dropping rapidly!

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:03.310
<i>Gen, the UN's deliberations 
will soon be complete.</i>

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:08.150
<i>The results depend on the situation
 in Japan, and with Hibiki Tachibana!</i>

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:10.410
We'll do all we can.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:11.590
We are!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.490
<i>Our situation is dire!</i>

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:19.430
<i>They may be willing to drop
 reactive weapons on their target!</i>

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.580
Hibiki-kun...

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:51.130
Is brushing aside the hands you held 
what you want to do, Hibiki Tachibana?

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:56.060
The compatibility coefficient has 
switched from dropping to rising!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.990
The divine weapon's defensive abilities

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.630
are rewriting the Anti-LiNKER's 
capabilities in real time...

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.660
The compatibility coefficient's decline 
has reversed, and it's rapidly rising!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.350
Yeah, we saw that coming.

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:08.950
But...

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:15.750
Hibiki!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.870
Hibiki-chan has stopped moving!

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:25.590
With the fusion depth increasing due to 
the rise in compatibility coefficient...

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.620
we can turn Miku-san's voice 
into an electrical signal

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:32.020
and insert it into Hibiki-san, 
the divine weapon's vessel!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.440
It's your birthday today!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.450
But...

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.890
But you're not here! It doesn't make sense!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.090
<i>She's calling me...</i>

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.490
<i>That voice...</i>

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:03.900
Hibiki... Happy Birthday!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:09.680
No... I'm sure that this 
feeling is a "Thank you."

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:13.110
Because you were born into 
the same world as me,

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:17.550
I was able to learn to 
run by someone's side.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:19.980
<i>Miku...</i>

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:23.560
You made me realize that 
if I was with someone else,

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.910
I may be able to reach goals 
I couldn't reach alone!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.280
Miku... my sunny spot!

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:34.790
Hibiki... My sun!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.890
Hibiki! I believed in you!

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:11.570
Hibiki-chan is okay! She's alive!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.570
<i>We've seen the situation here, too.</i>

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:20.570
<i>The UN's military intervention 
was voted down.</i>

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.580
Brother Yatsuhiro...

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:27.510
<i>In addition to all the things 
that S.O.N.G. has accomplished,</i>

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.850
<i>Secretary-General Shibata used the 
firmness he learned from soba noodles</i>

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.120
<i>to stick to the negotiations.</i>

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.870
People can connect.

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.380
They can become one.

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:42.110
<i>Yes. The reactive weapons won't be used.</i>

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:50.450
We've sighted a high-speed flying 
object launched from the Pacific Ocean!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.480
This is...

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.950
<i>They fired it?</i>

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:05.200
Our country got its start when people declared 
independence from a world of divine mysteries.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:09.890
This is a blow for the creation 
of a new world order,

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.960
of humanity, by humanity, for humanity!

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.420
Prepare to intercept!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.130
We can't! It's too close!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:18.640
Estimating impact in 330 seconds!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.150
We'll slice it apart, then!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:34.320
No! If it explodes, it could 
destroy the whole area,

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.630
and pollute it forever!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:44.600
Perhaps I stayed alive for this moment.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.240
What are you—

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.430
Can I do it alone?

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:05.310
No. "Even if that's true," wasn't it?

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:17.790
<i>The song of liberation sets my life afire</i>

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:24.790
<i>To bring flame to a coal-black darkness</i>

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.520
Cagliostro?

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:32.480
<i>The bell of liberation 
plays the melody of the end</i>

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.130
Prelati?

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:39.840
<i>Now give a victory shout of freedom</i>

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:51.550
<i>Light up an endless future with your death</i>

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.080
"Alone"?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.820
You're making me cry.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.500
You guys...

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:08.500
<i>Let your cursed blood boil</i>

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:13.550
<i>Head into hell with your heart beating loudly</i>

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.920
Those voices...

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.190
Hibiki!

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.180
Miku!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.090
<i>A sky of humiliation that 
makes you want to vomit</i>

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.090
Tsubasa-san... Everyone...

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.330
<i>Looking up into light</i>

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:26.680
<i>Let both edges of the blade shatter here</i>

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:20.850
And...

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:32.600
<i>I wanted an answer</i>

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:35.810
My women's intuition made me
 suspicious of the Director,

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:37.910
<i>Before I turn to dust I wanted 
to know my life had meaning</i>

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.900
so I faked my death and hid.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.610
<i>Even if I fade away</i>

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.740
And she saved me...

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:44.420
<i>I won't let you shout about resolve</i>

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:44.410
I'd been secretly working on a 
transmutation to get back at him.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:49.750
<i>I won't let you say this is destiny</i>

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:53.430
<i>Refuse! Refuse!</i>

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.210
<i>The mind is absolute</i>

00:17:55.210 --> 00:18:00.090
<i>Pound the stake of the period into falsehoods</i>

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:05.480
<i>Rip away at heavens for the sake of liberty</i>

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:14.030
<i>Let us take pride in all our beauty as we 
shine brighter than sunrise in our last song</i>

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.250
The reactive weapons detonated!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.200
Estimating shock wave impact...

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:26.720
What's this?

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:31.680
This, too, is the Lapis Philosophicus...

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:42.990
<i>"If" is an incomplete word</i>

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:46.020
<i>It's not for us.</i>

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.850
<i>The words of a dream</i>

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:53.790
<i>But if there was one "if" I could smile at</i>

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.840
<i>The purest light I can emit right now...</i>

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:54.120
<i>In other words, my masterpiece!</i>

00:18:53.790 --> 00:19:00.950
<i>I would want to have days I 
could long for with my friends</i>

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:59.680
<i>Research into the lapis was begun 
to find a way to break the curse.</i>

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.130
<i>And it's finally useful for somebody...</i>

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:07.080
<i>Now that I've closed my eyes</i>

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:06.490
<i>To be honest, I'd rather shove 
it up the Director's ass.</i>

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:12.690
<i>The bonds I've felt from human strength</i>

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.780
<i>But I'm surprised.</i>

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:10.380
<i>When did you take their hands?</i>

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:18.870
<i>Miracles overflowing like tears we'll never shed</i>

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.010
I did not take their hands.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.250
Internal energy pressure continues to rise!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.500
They won't be able to hold!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:23.880
<i>We want to entrust you with the reins of hope</i>

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.890
<i>Rise up! Rise up!</i>

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.630
Incinerating a complete life form...

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:29.280
<i>This soul of steel</i>

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:31.390
...is the light that leads to the lapis!

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:32.150
<i>Remains crucified</i>

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.510
<i>Until it fades away</i>

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:40.000
<i>Reveal all secrets and unlock the world</i>

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.020
I never took their hands.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:47.790
<i>We may be shy, but that's the only 
way we can clench our impudent fists.</i>

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.290
I couldn't.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:52.990
I could only dream of tomorrow by 
lighting up the future with death!

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.600
Looks like I dragged you with me.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:19.090
It's fine. I got to see something nice.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:19.820
Something nice?

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:22.450
Saint Germain, you're smiling.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:27.910
Yeah. How long has it been 
since I haven't wanted to die?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.260
Right, Mom?

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:46.090
Alchemists... Seekers of ideals...

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:49.060
Now we just need to deal 
with the divine energy...

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:53.970
I need to thank you.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:58.250
Adam Weishaupt!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.060
You're still after the power of the gods?

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:04.000
This time... it's in my hand!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:05.950
Let's stop him!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.780
Yeah!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.570
I won't let you stop me anymore.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:21.470
But even if that's true...

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:24.380
I won't let you near it.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.090
Adam, you meanie!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:29.940
You won't hug me, so I'll hug you!

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:31.880
Don't!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.510
This isn't just the ever-so-helpful
 power of the gods!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:39.180
A philosophical weapon filled 
with 2,000 years of curses!

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:42.350
If you use it, the curse will fall upon you!

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:46.220
I'll punch you with my song!
